# Rust build output.
# Cargo.lock IS committed on purpose: this repo ships release binaries, so the
# exact dependency set that produced them has to be reproducible.
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
.zed/
.fleet/
.helix/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store

# Runtime droppings. The tool logs to the terminal, but developing against a
# live game leaves these in the repo root or in the game dir when the game (or
# the tool) is launched from here: engine logs, auto-recorded POV demos
# (BHOPFIX_DEMOS=1), and core/minidumps from a crashed client.
*.log
*.dem
core
core.*
*.dmp
